Z||000003||Fformula88||11-30-2001||10:15 PM||||Although the police like to talk about car theft rings and all, statistically most cars are just stolen by punks for joy rides.  Unfortunately this doesn't make things much better, but I don't think bargaining is going to help.  Get plate #'s, color, anything "unique" about it and those who live in the area can keep an eye out.  I hope its found ok!||||reg||1
Z||000004||Formula88||11-30-2001||11:39 PM||||I can't imagine any Fiero owner stealing someone else's Fiero for parts.  I'm sure there are all types of people out there, but that's just too low.<P>Still, we do need detailed descriptions, plates, pics if possible - so we can put out the manhunt.<P>I hope your car is returned in tact.||||reg||8
